---
// src/components/Sambutan.astro
---
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 border-b border-slate-100">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative group">
            <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-2xl -rotate-3 transition-transform group-hover:rotate-0"></div>
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl glass-card border border-slate-200 shadow-2xl">
                <img 
                    src="https://smkn3linggabuana.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-03-at-12.44.16_80919b15-768x1035.jpg" 
                    alt="Kepala Sekolah SMKN 3 Linggabuana" 
                    class="w-full h-[550px] object-cover object-top grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-1000"
                />
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/40 to-transparent">
                    <p class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sm">Iyan Suryadi, S.Pd., M.Si.</p>
                    <p class="text-blue-400 text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-mono mt-1">Kepala Sekolah SMKN 3 Linggabuana</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
            <div class="w-16 h-[2px] bg-blue-600 mb-8"></div>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tighter text-slate-800 mb-10 uppercase">
                Visi & <span class="font-black text-blue-600">Sambutan</span>
            </h2>
            <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg font-light italic">
                <p>"Selamat datang di portal **Arsip Kurikulum Digital** SMKN 3 Linggabuana Purwakarta. Kehadiran platform ini adalah bukti nyata transformasi digital kami."</p>
                <p class="not-italic text-base text-slate-500">Kami percaya bahwa keterbukaan informasi dan kemudahan akses data adalah kunci utama menuju sekolah yang unggul.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12 pt-10 border-t border-slate-100 w-full flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8">
                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">Arsip Pengelola</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-800 uppercase">Ridho Kiswanto — 2026</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse"></div>
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 italic">Sistem Berjalan Normal</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>